      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunapee%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sunapee evolved from a farming community to an industrial hub powered by the Sugar River, then became a tourist spot served by train and steamboat in the 1870s.",
